## Step 3: Agreement checklist

- [ ] Territory and exclusivity (or none)
- [ ] Products or services covered
- [ ] Pricing, margin or commission
- [ ] Targets and minimum commitments
- [ ] Payment terms
- [ ] Branding and marketing rules
- [ ] Training and support obligations
