## Step 5: Manage and measure

| Metric | Target | Actual |
|---|---|---|
| Leads from partner | | |
| Deals closed | | |
| Revenue | | |
| Partner satisfaction | | |
| Training completed | | |

**Review rhythm:** monthly call, quarterly business review, annual agreement review.

## Warning signs

- No leads within the first 90 days
- Partner cannot explain your offer
- Customers complain about service
- The partner promotes competitors more actively

